{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Step Can Change Everything!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.poster.avif?t=1756446240\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.webm?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/3b4d0f7f73f75b53b3ac85029d85bf0d.mp4?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the free demo version of <strong><i>BLOKES on BLOCKS!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BLOKES on BLOCKS! is a party action game with simple controls that anyone can pick up and enjoy right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players clash on the stage and aim for victory by knocking their opponents out of the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*4 people + 2 cpu players</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In this demo, you can experience the following content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles on <strong>2 stages</strong> taken from the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 playable characters</strong> with <strong>2 costumes</strong> each</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 types of items</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0 Note: This demo includes only a portion of the full game. Additional content (such as more stages and costumes) will be available in the full version of BLOKES on BLOCKS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Simple Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the directional pad to move up, down, left, or right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will automatically perform actions depending on the terrain ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.poster.avif?t=1756446240\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.webm?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.mp4?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries about ledges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the most out-of-shape bloke can climb a one-block height with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.poster.avif?t=1756446240\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.webm?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.mp4?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Attack by Moving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you move into a space occupied by another player, you\u2019ll knock them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the opponent is already downed, your attack will send them flying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/dd14c191cf5b7412dcb050b43da26c9b.poster.avif?t=1756446240\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/dd14c191cf5b7412dcb050b43da26c9b.webm?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/dd14c191cf5b7412dcb050b43da26c9b.mp4?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taking hits increases your damage count making you easier to launch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep an eye on your damage gauge near your feet!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/9ca445b0155a3bf0e9626223cc505103.poster.avif?t=1756446240\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/9ca445b0155a3bf0e9626223cc505103.webm?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/9ca445b0155a3bf0e9626223cc505103.mp4?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Comebacks Are a Strategy Too</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Getting knocked out of the arena isn\u2019t the end!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, respawning is an opportunity to counterattack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a flashy return and let everyone know you\u2019re not the type to go down easy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/373298c789a3c298bf7ba7b233f576ce.poster.avif?t=1756446240\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/373298c789a3c298bf7ba7b233f576ce.webm?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/373298c789a3c298bf7ba7b233f576ce.mp4?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>This title is currently in development. We are committed to enhancing and expanding the game with the help of feedback from our players.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966230?t=1756446240","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966230?t=1756446240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/d955e28e46b9e3f057abd87654414fe9e3780062/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756446240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/d955e28e46b9e3f057abd87654414fe9e3780062/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756446240","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_suppor