, or right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will automatically perform actions depending on the terrain ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.poster.avif?t=1756446240\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.webm?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/351c692a2a68e90f5849ebeac078565f.mp4?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries about ledges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the most out-of-shape bloke can climb a one-block height with ease.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.poster.avif?t=1756446240\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.webm?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966230/extras/c6a1c192a9bde1dc1dadf52d061e5e51.mp4?t=1756446240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0 <strong>Attack by Moving</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you move into a space occupied by another player, you\u2019ll knock them down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the opponent is already downed, your attack will send them flying!</p><p class=\"b