ends around. With simple controls this game is easy to pick up and play, suitable for everyone. Your actions happen just by moving around. Timing is everything so predict your blokes' next moves and knock them off their blocks!","steam_appid":3966230,"support_info":{"email":"bob_support@crafts-meister.co.jp","url":"https://www.crafts-meister.co.jp/contact/"},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese","type":"demo","website":null}